      "en": "Behold, there was a great earthquake, for an angel of the Lord descended from the sky and came and rolled away the stone from the door and sat on it.",
      "ko": "큰 지진이 나며 주의 천사가 하늘로서 내려와 돌을 굴려 내고 그 위에 앉았는데",
      "source_text_hash": "1295f517ea1517545bd9ee679d205bc753eed17b2e1b661aba10aa4553d16888",
      "translation_text_hash": "38877246bbf20017828ca19ce06fb9a9c239813dfec7e6661bb82415bec2208b",
